<section class="about-page">

  <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT INKWELL</p>

  <h1>A small place for ideas worth sharing.</h1>

  <div class="about-content">

    <p>
      INKWELL is a simple personal publishing platform built with
      Node.js, Express, EJS, HTML, CSS and JavaScript.
    </p>

    <p>
      The project was created to explore how a web application works
      from the browser to the server and back again.
    </p>

    <h2>Built with fundamentals</h2>

    <p>
      Instead of relying on a frontend framework or database,
      INKWELL focuses on understanding the fundamentals:
      HTTP requests, routing, forms, server-side rendering,
      JavaScript and responsive design.
    </p>

  </div>

  <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to articles</a>

</section>

